  "effectScaling": {
    "_doc": "Tower effects grow with their research. Effect level 1-10 = levels of the two chance technologies (Chance I + Chance II); Mastery 0-3 = the Mastery technology. At level L, [a, b] means a at level 1 up to b at level 10 (linear). 'flat' is damage, multiplied by towerLevelMul of the tower level, through defense, never crits. 'base' fields apply from level 1, each 'mastery' entry adds its fields on top (Mastery 3 = the full effect). 'hitPct': share of the hit (with crits) used when it beats the flat damage. 'status': fields of the status effect replaced for this effect (value there wins over the 'value' range). 'plus': one entry per level of the technology under the Mastery (full values of that level; needs the Mastery at max). 'flatSet': flat damage of a Mastery level instead of the research range (x towerLevelMul too).",
    "levels": 10,
    "towerLevelMul": [
      1,
      1.5,
      2
    ]
  }
